X:1
T:Hungarian Dance No. 5
C:Johannes Brahms
O:Hungarian Dance No. 5 in F-sharp minor, after Kéler Béla's csárdás Bártfai emlék
N:The main theme only (16 bars). The contrasting section reaches B-flat 5 in this
N:key and the repeat opens with an arpeggio from A3, so both are left out.
N:Transposed down a major third from F-sharp minor so the theme fits C4 to A5.
N:Melody from the flutetunes.com MIDI. Chords derived from the melody.
